        "content": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"zh-CN\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n<title>3.分数加减混合运算 - 第1课时</title>\n<script>\nwindow.MathJax = { tex: { inlineMath: [['$', '$']], displayMath: [['$$', '$$']] } };\n</script>\n<script src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/mathjax@3/es5/tex-mml-chtml.js\" id=\"MathJax-script\" async></script>\n<style>\n  body {\n    font-family: \"PingFang SC\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", \"SimSun\", sans-serif;\n    background: #ddd;\n    margin: 0;\n    padding: 20px 0;\n    color: #111;\n  }\n  .page {\n    position: relative;\n    width: 560px;\n    margin: 0 auto;\n    background: #fdfcf8;\n    padding: 18px 22px 40px 22px;\n    box-shadow: 0 0 10px rgba(0,0,0,0.3);\n    font-size: 13px;\n    line-height: 1.5;\n  }\n  .header {\n    display: flex;\n    align-items: center;\n    justify-content: space-between;\n    border-bottom: 2px solid #2a6fb5;\n    padding-bottom: 6px;\n    margin-bottom: 10px;\n  }\n  .header .brand {\n    display: flex;\n    align-items: center;\n    font-size: 15px;\n    font-weight: bold;\n    color: #2a6fb5;\n  }\n  .header .brand .icon {\n    width: 20px; height: 20px;\n    border-radius: 50%;\n    background: #2a6fb5;\n    color: #fff;\n    display: inline-flex;\n    align-items: center;\n    justify-content: center;\n    font-size: 11px;\n    margin-right: 6px;\n  }\n  .header .meta {\n    font-size: 12px;\n    color: #333;\n  }\n  h1.main-title {\n    text-align: center;\n    font-size: 17px;\n    margin: 10px 0 4px 0;\n  }\n  h2.sub-title {\n    text-align: center;\n    font-size: 15px;\n    font-weight: bold;\n    margin: 4px 0 14px 0;\n  }\n  .explore-tag {\n    display: inline-block;\n    background: #d64545;\n    color: #fff;\n    font-weight: bold;\n    font-size: 12px;\n    padding: 2px 10px;\n    border-radius: 3px 3px 3px 3px;\n  }\n  .explore-tag2 {\n    font-weight: bold;\n    color: #2a6fb5;\n    font-size: 13px;\n    margin-left: 4px;\n  }\n  .explore-row {\n    display: flex;\n    align-items: center;\n    margin-bottom: 8px;\n  }\n  .intro-text {\n    margin: 6px 0 10px 0;\n    text-indent: 2em;\n  }\n  table {\n    border-collapse: collapse;\n    width: 100%;\n    margin: 6px 0 16px 0;\n    font-size: 12px;\n    text-align: center;\n  }\n  table th, table td {\n    border: 1px solid #333;\n    padding: 5px 3px;\n  }\n  table th {\n    background: #f2f2f2;\n    font-weight: normal;\n    width: 90px;\n  }\n  .columns {\n    display: flex;\n    margin-top: 6px;\n  }\n  .col-left {\n    width: 50%;\n    padding-right: 10px;\n    box-sizing: border-box;\n  }\n  .col-right {\n    width: 50%;\n    padding-left: 12px;\n    border-left: 2px solid #2a6fb5;\n    box-sizing: border-box;\n    position: relative;\n  }\n  .qnum {\n    font-weight: bold;\n  }\n  .method-label {\n    font-weight: bold;\n    margin: 10px 0 4px 0;\n  }\n  .step {\n    margin: 4px 0;\n    padding-left: 4px;\n  }\n  .arrow-note {\n    color: #333;\n    font-size: 12px;\n  }\n  /* fraction rendering */\n  .frac {\n    display: inline-block;\n    vertical-align: middle;\n    text-align: center;\n    margin: 0 2px;\n    font-size: 12px;\n    position: relative;\n    top: 2px;\n  }\n  .frac .num, .frac .den {\n    display: block;\n    padding: 0 4px;\n    line-height: 1.1;\n  }\n  .frac .num {\n    border-bottom: 1px solid #000;\n  }\n  .circle {\n    display: inline-block;\n    border: 1.5px solid #c0392b;\n    border-radius: 50%;\n    padding: 0 3px;\n    color: #c0392b;\n  }\n  .op {\n    font-size: 13px;\n    margin: 0 2px;\n  }\n  .placeholder {\n    border: 1px dashed #999;\n    background: #f5f5f5;\n    color: #888;\n    font-size: 10px;\n    display: flex;\n    align-items: center;\n    justify-content: center;\n    text-align: center;\n    box-sizing: border-box;\n  }\n  .robot-row {\n    display: flex;\n    align-items: flex-start;\n    justify-content: flex-end;\n    margin-bottom: 6px;\n  }\n  .robot-icon {\n    width: 40px;\n    height: 40px;\n    margin-right: 6px;\n    flex-shrink: 0;\n  }\n  .bubble {\n    color: #b03030;\n    font-size: 11px;\n    line-height: 1.3;\n    max-width: 150px;\n    font-family: \"KaiTi\", \"STKaiti\", cursive;\n  }\n  .red-note {\n    color: #b03030;\n    font-family: \"KaiTi\", \"STKaiti\", cursive;\n    font-size: 12px;\n    line-height: 1.3;\n  }\n  .char-figure {\n    width: 45px;\n    height: 65px;\n    float: right;\n    margin: 2px 0 4px 8px;\n  }\n  .q3-block {\n    margin-top: 14px;\n  }\n  .highlight-box {\n    border: 1.5px solid #b03030;\n    color: #b03030;\n    padding: 0 3px;\n    font-family: \"KaiTi\", \"STKaiti\", cursive;\n  }\n  .footer {\n    display: flex;\n    align-items: center;\n    margin-top: 24px;\n  }\n  .page-num {\n    width: 22px;\n    height: 22px;\n    border-radius: 50%;\n    background: #2a6fb5;\n    color: #fff;\n    display: flex;\n    align-items: center;\n    justify-content: center;\n    font-size: 12px;\n    margin-right: 6px;\n  }\n  .flower {\n    color: #2a6fb5;\n    font-size: 14px;\n  }\n  .clearfix::after {\n    content: \"\";\n    display: block;\n    clear: both;\n  }\n</style>\n</head>\n<body>\n<div class=\"page\">\n\n  <div class=\"header\">\n    <div class=\"brand\"><span class=\"icon\">书</span>同步解析与测评</div>\n    <div class=\"meta\">数学&nbsp;&nbsp;五年级&nbsp;&nbsp;下册</div>\n  </div>\n\n  <h1 class=\"main-title\">3.分数加减混合运算</h1>\n  <h2 class=\"sub-title\">第1课时&nbsp;&nbsp;分数加减混合运算</h2>\n\n  <div class=\"explore-row\">\n    <span class=\"explore-tag\">探究</span><span class=\"explore-tag2\">交流</span>\n  </div>\n\n  <p class=\"intro-text\">\n    小华收集整理的全班同学在母亲节送给妈妈的礼物情况如下表：\n  </p>\n\n  <table>\n    <tr>\n      <th>礼物类型</th>\n      <td>贺卡</td>\n      <td>鲜花</td>\n      <td>自己画的画</td>\n      <td>其他</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <th>占全班人数的几分之几</th>\n      <td>\n        <span class=\"frac\"><span class=\"num\">1</span><span class=\"den\">4</span></span>\n      </td>\n      <td>\n        <span class=\"frac\"><span class=\"num\">3</span><span class=\"den\">20</span></span>\n      </td>\n      <td>\n        <span class=\"frac\"><span class=\"num\">3</span><span class=\"den\">10</span></span>\n      </td>\n      <td></td>\n    </tr>\n  </table>\n\n  <div class=\"columns\">\n\n    <!-- LEFT COLUMN -->\n    <div class=\"col-left\">\n      <p><span class=\"qnum\">1.</span>送贺卡和送鲜花的同学比自己画的画\n      的同学多占全班人数的几分之几？</p>\n\n      <div class=\"method-label\">方法一：</div>\n      <div class=\"step\">\n        <span class=\"frac\"><span class=\"num\">1</span><span class=\"den\">4</span></span>\n        <span class=\"op\">+</span>\n        <span class=\"frac\"><span class=\"num\">3</span><span class=\"den\">20</span></span>\n        <span class=\"op\">－</span>\n        <span class=\"frac\"><span class=\"num\">3</span><span class=\"den\">10</span></span>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"step\">\n        <span class=\"op\">=</span>\n        <span class=\"frac\"><span class=\"num\"><span class=\"circle\">5</span></span><span class=\"den\">20</span></span>\n        <span class=\"op\">+</span>\n        <span class=\"frac\"><span class=\"num\">3</span><span class=\"den\">20</span></span>\n        <span class=\"op\">－</span>\n        <span class=\"frac\"><span class=\"num\">3</span><span class=\"den\">10</span></span>\n        <span class=\"arrow-note\">　→通分</span>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"step\">\n        <span class=\"op\">=</span>\n        <span class=\"frac\"><span class=\"num\"><span class=\"circle\">8</span></span><span class=\"den\">20</span></span>\n        <span class=\"op\">－</span>\n        <span class=\"frac\"><span class=\"num\"><span class=\"circle\">6</span></span><span class=\"den\">20</span></span>\n        <span class=\"arrow-note\">　→再次通分</span>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"step\">\n        <span class=\"op\">=</span>\n        <span class=\"frac\"><span class=\"num\"><span class=\"circle\">2</span></span><span class=\"den\">20</span></span>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"step\">\n        <span class=\"op\">=</span>\n        <span class=\"frac\"><span class=\"num\"><span class=\"circle\">1</span></span><span class=\"den\">10</span></span>\n      </div>\n\n      <div class=\"method-label\">方法二：</div>\n      <div class=\"step\">\n        <span class=\"frac\"><span class=\"num\">1</span><span class=\"den\">4</span></span>\n        <span class=\"op\">+</span>\n        <span class=\"frac\"><span class=\"num\">3</span><span class=\"den\">20</span></span>\n        <span class=\"op\">－</span>\n        <span class=\"frac\"><span class=\"num\">3</span><span class=\"den\">10</span></span>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"step\">\n        <span class=\"op\">=</span>\n        <span class=\"frac\"><span class=\"num\"><span class=\"circle\">5</span></span><span class=\"den\">20</span></span>\n        <span class=\"op\">+</span>\n        <span class=\"frac\"><span class=\"num\">3</span><span class=\"den\">20</span></span>\n        <span class=\"op\">－</span>\n        <span class=\"frac\"><span class=\"num\"><span class=\"circle\">6</span></span><span class=\"den\">20</span></span>\n        <span class=\"arrow-note\">　→一次通分</span>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"step\">\n        <span class=\"op\">=</span>\n        <span class=\"frac\"><span class=\"num\"><span class=\"circle\">2</span></span><span class=\"den\">20</span></span>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"step\">\n        <span class=\"op\">=</span>\n        <span class=\"frac\"><span class=\"num\"><span class=\"circle\">1</span></span><span class=\"den\">10</span></span>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <!-- RIGHT COLUMN -->\n    <div class=\"col-right\">\n\n      <div class=\"robot-row\">\n        <div class=\"placeholder robot-icon\">[机器人]</div>\n        <div class=\"bubble\">这两种方法有什么不同？哪一种简便？<br>通分次数不同，方法二简便</div>\n      </div>\n\n      <p><span class=\"qnum\">2.</span>送其他礼物的同学占全班人数的几分\n      之几？</p>\n\n      <div class=\"method-label\">方法一：</div>\n      <div class=\"step\">1 －\n        <span class=\"frac\"><span class=\"num\">1</span><span class=\"den\">4</span></span>\n        －\n        <span class=\"frac\"><span class=\"num\">3</span><span class=\"den\">20</span></span>\n        －\n        <span class=\"frac\"><span class=\"num\">3</span><span class=\"den\">10</span></span>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"step\">\n        = 1 －\n        <span class=\"frac\"><span class=\"num\">5</span><span class=\"den\">20</span></span>\n        －\n        <span class=\"frac\"><span class=\"num\">3</span><span class=\"den\">20</span></span>\n        －\n        <span class=\"frac\"><span class=\"num\">6</span><span class=\"den\">20</span></span>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"step clearfix\">\n        <div class=\"placeholder char-figure\">[人物插图]</div>\n        <div class=\"red-note\">这两个算式有<br>什么不同呢？</div>\n        =\n        <span class=\"frac\"><span class=\"num\">20</span><span class=\"den\">20</span></span>\n        －\n        <span class=\"frac\"><span class=\"num\">5</span><span class=\"den\">20</span></span>\n        －\n        <span class=\"frac\"><span class=\"num\">3</span><span class=\"den\">20</span></span>\n        －\n        <span class=\"frac\"><span class=\"num\">6</span><span class=\"den\">20</span></span>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"step\">\n        =\n        <span class=\"frac\"><span class=\"num\">6</span><span class=\"den\">20</span></span>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"step\">\n        =\n        <span class=\"frac\"><span class=\"num\">3</span><span class=\"den\">10</span></span>\n      </div>\n\n      <div class=\"method-label\">方法二：</div>\n      <div class=\"step\">\n        1 －\n        (\n        <span class=\"frac\"><span class=\"num\">1</span><span class=\"den\">4</span></span>\n        +\n        <span class=\"frac\"><span class=\"num\">3</span><span class=\"den\">20</span></span>\n        +\n        <span class=\"frac\"><span class=\"num\">3</span><span class=\"den\">10</span></span>\n        )\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"step\">\n        =\n        1 － (\n        <span class=\"frac\"><span class=\"num\">5</span><span class=\"den\">20</span></span>\n        +\n        <span class=\"frac\"><span class=\"num\">3</span><span class=\"den\">20</span></span>\n        +\n        <span class=\"frac\"><span class=\"num\">6</span><span class=\"den\">20</span></span>\n        )\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"step\">\n        =\n        1 －\n        <span class=\"frac\"><span class=\"num\">14</span><span class=\"den\">20</span></span>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"step\">\n        =\n        <span class=\"frac\"><span class=\"num\">6</span><span class=\"den\">20</span></span>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"step\">\n        =\n        <span class=\"frac\"><span class=\"num\">3</span><span class=\"den\">10</span></span>\n      </div>\n\n      <div class=\"q3-block clearfix\">\n        <div class=\"placeholder char-figure\">[人物插图：指向文字]</div>\n        <p><span class=\"qnum\">3.</span>通过前面的计算，你能说一说分数加减混\n        合运算的运算顺序吗？</p>\n        <p>分数加减混合运算的计算顺序和整数加减混合运算\n        的运算顺序<span class=\"highlight-box\">相同</span>。</p>\n        <p>没有括号的，按照<span class=\"highlight-box\">从左到右</span>\n        的顺序计算；有括号的，先算<span class=\"highlight-box\">括号里的</span>\n        再算<span class=\"highlight-box\">括号外的</span>。</p>\n        <div class=\"placeholder char-figure\" style=\"margin-top:4px;\">[人物插图：指向文字]</div>\n      </div>\n\n    </div>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"footer\">\n    <span class=\"page-num\">70</span>\n    <span class=\"flower\">✿</span>\n  </div>\n\n</div>\n</body>\n</html>"
      },
